# Setup panel chrome

Flyouts (Materials, boundary conditions, Mesh, Result control, Refinements) use **Done** to close and **Delete** only when something can be removed.

Do **not** add a checkmark / tick button in a panel header. That control is unused and no other live panel has it.

Settings persist on Apply, Generate, or the field change that already saves. Keep this pattern on every new panel.
